Modifications in bpytop-nv:
  - Added a GPU box and GPU collector for NVIDIA GPUs, using the NVIDIA
    Management Library (libnvidia-ml) via ctypes.
  - GPU-aware box layout, the "gpu" view preset and the [5] toggle key.
  - Config and log files moved to ~/.config/bpytop-nv.
  - Packaged for pip as the bpytop_nv package, with bpytop's themes bundled
    in bpytop_nv/bpytop-themes (unmodified, Apache License 2.0).

The GPU view is inspired by nvtop (https://github.com/Syllo/nvtop), which is
licensed under GPLv3. No nvtop source code is included in this project.

